WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.234
TraySense

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:03.628
a 100 KB open-source

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.666
taskbar monitor

00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:06.475
DM TWEAKS launched

00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:07.065
TraySense

00:00:07.159 --> 00:00:08.208
a tiny Windows

00:00:08.020 --> 00:00:09.352
taskbar monitor that

00:00:09.164 --> 00:00:10.355
shows CPU

00:00:10.508 --> 00:00:11.322
GPU

00:00:11.593 --> 00:00:13.067
RAM and VRAM

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:14.517
usage plus CPU

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.381
GPU and SSD

00:00:16.192 --> 00:00:17.065
temperatures

00:00:17.206 --> 00:00:19.152
while using 1-3 MB

00:00:18.964 --> 00:00:19.682
of RAM

00:00:20.206 --> 00:00:21.267
The launch post

00:00:21.079 --> 00:00:22.682
passed 2,000 likes

00:00:22.821 --> 00:00:24.318
CPU temperature needs

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:25.332
the PawnIO driver

00:00:25.215 --> 00:00:26.311
which it installs

00:00:26.123 --> 00:00:27.054
on demand

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:28.663
TraySense is a

00:00:28.474 --> 00:00:29.559
single C file

00:00:29.371 --> 00:00:31.009
using plain Win32

00:00:31.163 --> 00:00:32.047
so the exe

00:00:31.859 --> 00:00:33.828
is around 100 KB

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.098
Inspired by the

00:00:34.910 --> 00:00:36.348
amazing invention by

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:37.304
KrisGfx

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:38.844
Full story on

00:00:38.655 --> 00:00:39.551
the dashboard
